  <name>KLog</name>
  <developer_name>Jaime Robles</developer_name>
  <summary>Multiplatform free hamradio logger</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      KLog is a multiplatform free hamradio logger. It runs natively on Linux, macOS and Windows.
    </p>
    <p>
      KLog is providing QSO management, useful QSL management DX-Cluster client, DXCC management, ClubLog integration, WSJT-X, DX-Marathon support and much more!
    </p>
  </description>

